  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "Ping for review — fixes the #55087 stale-weights bug for GLM-5.3 KDA in online-RL refit loops. Verified on MI350X against a real `Glm5NextLinearAttention`: cache invalidates on any loader-mediated weight write, rebuilds from the new values, and no spurious invalidation on untouched layers. The gap (raw `param.copy_` refits bypassing loaders) is documented in the PR.\n\n@gdhyi @dllehr-amd\n",
